  "system": {
    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements:</strong> Body (3), Expertise (1) in Melee Weapons</p><p>You aim your strike to sunder armor.</p><p>Make a melee attack. If you succeed, the target does not suffer damage.</p><p>Instead, their <strong>Armor</strong> takes <strong>Damage</strong> equal to the number of successes on your attack, with the maximum amount of <strong>Damage</strong> being equal to your <strong>Expertise</strong> in <strong>Melee Weapons</strong>.</p><p>This does not allow you to bypass the resistance granted to magical armor. Only <strong>Magical</strong> weapons can damage <strong>Magical</strong> armor, as normal.</p>",
